    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "You don't say. As if being \"famous\" was the worst part of it.
      \nPeople like you with nothing but simple questions about my personal life
      are just an unavoidable trait of my job.\nIt's the people who believe to already
      know enough about me who make things difficult, since they are the ones that
      always feel the need to... \"do something\" about me."
