    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Why do you think I chose a place in the middle of nowhere such
      as this?

      Trust me, I know how to deal with these things... some day,
      someone will get me, but today is not that day, I know it...

      Then again,
      I''m not entirely sure why someone like you is so interested on my safety...
      unless...'
