    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...yeah, sure. And I suppose you''re now expecting me to "be cooperative"
      so that you may "protect me" from a "menace".

      Pro tip, kid: if you''re
      going to try and spy a major figure, make sure not to use the oldest trick
      from the book first.

      Do yourself a favour and get out of my sight.'
