    - rid: 3046478613006778460
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Let me guess, was it the man who always seems to look confused?
          Yeah, that''s... Ilya, I think his name was.

          I had to be driven
          here by him after his incompetence caused my car to stop working in the
          middle of the road.

          I would advise not spending much time with
          him, unless you want him to ruin your stuff out of pure idiocy.'
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
