    - rid: 3046478908010004713
      type: {class: AltDialoguePath, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        altDialogue: "Wow, you're persistent. \nLet me make myself clear: no, I'm
          not interested in talking to a spy like you."
        dialogueReference: {fileID: 0}
        condition:
          dialogueText: '...yeah, sure. And I suppose you''re now expecting me to
            "be cooperative" so that you may "protect me" from a "menace".

            Pro
            tip, kid: if you''re going to try and spy a major figure, make sure not
            to use the oldest trick from the book first.

            Do yourself
            a favour and get out of my sight.'
          characterEmotion: 0
          characterReaction: 0
          doesItProveAnything: 0
          isKey: 0
          responses: []
          isRootNode: 0
